{"overview":"گروهی از تازه‌فارغ‌التحصیلان برای یک شب‌نشینی آخرین بار به سمت غذا می‌روند، اما به‌طور تصادفی به جاده‌ای دو باندی و بی‌پایان که پر از وحشت‌های نامکشوف و نیروهای کیهانی فراتر از درکشان است، می‌پیچند؛ در داخل جیپ چروکی فشرده شده‌اند و با مسافتی که بی‌نهایت به جلو کشیده می‌شود، باید تصمیم بگیرند: وجود جدیدشان را بپذیرند یا برای فرار مبارزه کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A group of recent grads head out on a late night drive for grub, hoping to enjoy one final hangout before their paths diverge. Instead, they accidentally turn onto a never-ending, two-lane hellscape surrounded by untold horrors and cosmic forces beyond their understanding. Cramped together inside a Jeep Cherokee and with the miles stretching infinitely ahead, they face a choice: embrace their new existence or fight to escape it.","tagline_en":"Some wrong turns last forever.","runtime":89,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Alexander Ullom"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Phinehas Yoon","role":"James","photo":"/4QPjUk5XRcK31hq5sfeuS1MjL1I.jpg"},{"name":"Akira Jackson","role":"Day","photo":"/6rTQ373bfj3TvPigeciCqteEPZg.jpg"},{"name":"Noah Toth","role":"Fisher","photo":"/cj6dL9qUnrSVOlaQBOvLiGzjdEk.jpg"},{"name":"Mitchell Cole","role":"Tyler","photo":"/zsnkkaOPiBgLmQODpAE8GBcE0YT.jpg"},{"name":"Jenny Doyle","role":"Fisher's Mom (voice)","photo":""},{"name":"Jon Linstad","role":"Interrogated Man","photo":""},{"name":"Ian Weir","role":"Lost Man","photo":""},{"name":"Alexander Ullom","role":"Passenger","photo":"/neVbiMVlEks9TkChp5qmhS65wiB.jpg"},{"name":"Antonio Andrés Rosello","role":"Background Cast","photo":"/uC54bxPZCUCEA2kMOe897pqiOeg.jpg"},{"name":"Dakota Shiver","role":"Background Cast","photo":""},{"name":"Dennis Brewer","role":"Background Cast","photo":""},{"name":"Grace Wu","role":"Background Cast","photo":"/dxjGsCBmIqzMl2YpyBhYi9JhXmK.jpg"}],"trailer":"mQj2Hm7TXLQ","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1422011-it-ends/watch?